                    "Esports Charts published a study on 22 October comparing <mark>15 major esports tournaments</mark> that ended in the third quarter against their 2025 editions.  Its finding, in its own words: community broadcasts accounted for <mark>almost 50 percent of the hours watched</mark>.  Co-streaming means an independent creator rebroadcasting somebody else's event on their own channel, with their own commentary.",
