                    "What changed is the subject, and the shape around it.  Runtime is flat throughout, 16 to 36 minutes.  The baseline block is interior build-out: finishing a bedroom at 192,931, an A-frame room at 163,611, building a custom ice ripper for the driveway at 122,361.  The recent block is <mark>one serialised countdown with food at the end of it</mark>.",
