                    "The mechanism is worth understanding because it explains why the rise lands where it does.  Local stations carry pre-emption clauses that let them bump a brand's spot for a political one, so that displaced money moves to national inventory and to streaming services that refuse political advertising.  Demand concentrates on the surfaces that cannot be pre-empted, and the price there goes up.",
